  data: {
    LLM: 'Phase 1: All players play one card to each trick; highest rank wins the trick. If there is a tie for highest, the tied players play again until the tie is broken. After each play, players draw from the stock to keep three cards until the stock is empty. The last card of the stock sets the trump suit for Phase 2. When the stock is exhausted, play continues without drawing until the player whose turn it is has no card to play; then Phase 2 begins. Phase 2: The holder of the trump card leads. You must either beat the previous card or sequence (higher same suit or any trump) or pick up the lowest card or sequence from the trick. The last player left with cards loses and is the Dog.',
    Player: 'Phase 1: All players play one card to each trick; highest rank wins the trick. If there is a tie for highest, the tied players play again until the tie is broken. After each play, players draw from the stock to keep three cards until the stock is empty. The last card of the stock sets the trump suit for Phase 2. When the stock is exhausted, play continues without drawing until the player whose turn it is has no card to play; then Phase 2 begins. Phase 2: The holder of the trump card leads. You must either beat the previous card or sequence (higher same suit or any trump) or pick up the lowest card or sequence from the trick. The last player left with cards loses and is the Dog.',
    objective: 'Avoid being the last player left with cards in your hand at the end of Phase Two.',
    gameplay: 'Phase 1: All players play one card to each trick; highest rank wins the trick. If there is a tie for highest, the tied players play again until the tie is broken. After each play, players draw from the stock to keep three cards until the stock is empty. The last card of the stock sets the trump suit for Phase 2. When the stock is exhausted, play continues without drawing until the player whose turn it is has no card to play; then Phase 2 begins. Phase 2: The holder of the trump card leads. You must either beat the previous card or sequence (higher same suit or any trump) or pick up the lowest card or sequence from the trick. The last player left with cards loses and is the Dog.',
